{"4459820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Touhou Yukkuri Mountain", "steam_appid": 4459820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4620300], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Puzzle: Take It Easy!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Project characters are here in their &quot;Yukkuri&quot; forms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack up the &quot;Yukkuri&quot; and create your very own &quot;Yukkuri Mountain&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/60d53d7571f7511d01e20063c96c51e0.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ How to Play</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw, Merge, and Grow!: Just drop the &quot;Yukkuri&quot; into the bowl! When two of the same kind touch, they transform into a larger Yukkuri!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Let Them Fall!: It's Game Over if the Yukkuri overflow from the bowl...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the High Score!: Growing them large and triggering consecutive merges (Chains) will skyrocket your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/cd8ae5faa4293405be3d1c51fd9f7600.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Reimu &amp; Marisa’s Live Commentary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu and Marisa chat away with game-style commentary based on your play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their lively banter and reactions make every match even more exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/4e5c14815391f4b7e1d6068fb974cd5b.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Fully Customizable Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Different Yukkuri!: Play the game, earn points, and head to the shop to unlock new Yukkuri.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/8d86e7121e348ecae5d552ca1b9376ba.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the Evolution Order!: You can swap the order of evolution! Set your favorite character as the largest size and create your very own &quot;Yukkuri Mountain&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/b73e1a79f40dce9c1ee6cbae9528bab6.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Supports local matches for up to 4 players! Enjoy a heart-pounding stacking battle together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※In addition to local play, you can also use the &quot;Remote Play Together&quot; feature to play with friends who don't even own the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings: Compete with players worldwide for the top score and prove you’re the ultimate Yukkuri master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/d584219b195066dd7f7a2b5a458baa4a.avif?t=1784163954\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras_big/d584219b195066dd7f7a2b5a458baa4a.avif?t=1784163954 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Puzzle: Take It Easy!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Project characters are here in their &quot;Yukkuri&quot; forms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack up the &quot;Yukkuri&quot; and create your very own &quot;Yukkuri Mountain&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/60d53d7571f7511d01e20063c96c51e0.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ How to Play</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw, Merge, and Grow!: Just drop the &quot;Yukkuri&quot; into the bowl! When two of the same kind touch, they transform into a larger Yukkuri!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Let Them Fall!: It's Game Over if the Yukkuri overflow from the bowl...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the High Score!: Growing them large and triggering consecutive merges (Chains) will skyrocket your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/cd8ae5faa4293405be3d1c51fd9f7600.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Reimu &amp; Marisa’s Live Commentary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu and Marisa chat away with game-style commentary based on your play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their lively banter and reactions make every match even more exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/4e5c14815391f4b7e1d6068fb974cd5b.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Fully Customizable Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Different Yukkuri!: Play the game, earn points, and head to the shop to unlock new Yukkuri.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/8d86e7121e348ecae5d552ca1b9376ba.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the Evolution Order!: You can swap the order of evolution! Set your favorite character as the largest size and create your very own &quot;Yukkuri Mountain&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/b73e1a79f40dce9c1ee6cbae9528bab6.avif?t=1784163954\" width=1316 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Supports local matches for up to 4 players! Enjoy a heart-pounding stacking battle together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※In addition to local play, you can also use the &quot;Remote Play Together&quot; feature to play with friends who don't even own the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings: Compete with players worldwide for the top score and prove you’re the ultimate Yukkuri master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras/d584219b195066dd7f7a2b5a458baa4a.avif?t=1784163954\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/extras_big/d584219b195066dd7f7a2b5a458baa4a.avif?t=1784163954 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "3D Puzzle: Take It Easy!!! Touhou Project characters are here in their &quot;&quot;Yukkuri&quot;&quot; forms! Stack up the &quot;&quot;Yukkuri&quot;&quot; and create your very own &quot;&quot;Yukkuri Mountain&quot;&quot;!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/e2d2e6c21d6caf465258d5fb4cafb5af52fee8c0/header.jpg?t=1784163954", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/447f287683011676c7826887c0684f488907bf60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784163954", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459820/447f287683011676c7826887c0684f488907bf60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784163954", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i7 4770 以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong>